WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.550
Hello Michigan, I'm Conan O'Brien.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:07.160
I was born in Brookline,
Massachusetts, but in my heart,

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.060
I've always been a Michigander.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.120
What can I say?

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.570
I love my donuts from Dilla's,
and my beer from Bell's.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.839
And because I love Michigan,
I'm urging all of you,

00:00:17.839 --> 00:00:21.330
including the Yoopers, to
vote in the upcoming election.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.010
Voting is a cornerstone of our democracy.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.490
If you like democracy, but you don't vote,

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.120
You're not playing
Euchre with a full deck.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.840
It's like saying I like Great Wolf Lodge,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.070
but not family friendly water parks.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.930
Or I like Vernors, but not ginger ale.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.970
Or I like islands where
cars aren't allowed

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.470
and everyone sells fudge,
but I don't like Mackinaw.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.053
It just doesn't make sense.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.290
So get out and vote, 'cause
if you don't you're kind

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:52.629
of letting other states that
aren't as awesome as Michigan,

00:00:52.629 --> 00:00:55.687
(whispers) Ohio.

00:00:55.687 --> 00:00:57.845
Make decisions about your education,

00:00:57.845 --> 00:01:00.403
your water, your roads, and your jobs.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.280
Unlike Jim Harbaugh, voting costs nothing,

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.780
it's very effective, and
it lives up to the hype.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.250
So whether you're in Detroit,
Grand Rapids, or way up

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:16.726
in Cheboygan, love the hot
dogs at Duke's, Cheboygan.

00:01:16.726 --> 00:01:18.140
(howls)

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:19.800
It's important that you vote.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.170
And as an honorary
Michigander, my vote is going

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:26.690
to the guy who'll fix
the potholes around here.

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.010
If you're not a registered voter

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.519
in Michigan, you've still got time.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.500
Hope this face doesn't haunt your dreams.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.550
See you at the Fleetwood Diner,

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:40.273
the one in East Lansing,
not the one in Ann Arbor.

